{"hymn":"S901","parent":"E1333","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":1},"title":"¡Qué día tan feliz","subtitle":"El evangelio—General","syl":{"n1":"¡Qué","n2":"dí‿a","n3":"tan","n4":["fe","i"],"n5":["liz,","t"],"n7":["Cuan","i"],"n8":["do","t"],"n9":"no","n10":["pu","i"],"n11":["de","t"],"n12":["re","i"],"n13":["sis","m"],"n14":["tir,","t"],"n16":"Y","n17":["Cris","i"],"n18":["to","t"],"n19":"me","n20":["sa","i"],"n21":["có","t"],"n22":"de","n23":["la‿os","i"],"n24":["cu","m"],"n25":["ri","m"],"n26":["dad","t"],"n27":"Al","n28":["Rei","i"],"n29":["no","t"],"n30":"de","n31":"Su","n32":["cla","i"],"n33":["ri","m"],"n34":["dad!","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Disfrutando voy","La vida que en el Hijo está;","Futiles sueños no me cautivan ya,","Un río hay en mi corazón."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Al volverme a Él,","Su vida llenará mi ser;","Su vida es en mí una realidad,","¡Oh, grande es mi felicidad!"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["¡Te amo, mi Señor!","Tú desvaneces otro amor;","Mi vida Tú serás por la eternidad,","El único eres en verdad."]}]}